A wrapped Vulkan device whose enabled features are not known (a Vulkan game's, which the provider cannot query):
DeviceCreationVKDesc::unknownFeatures. NRI then reads no feature as supported (so no device addresses, maintenance4 or
extended dynamic state) and uses Vulkan 1.0's copies; where "synchronization2" is off it records barriers and
timestamps with Vulkan 1.0's vkCmdPipelineBarrier and vkCmdWriteTimestamp instead of requiring it. Queue submissions
stay vkQueueSubmit2 (a provider in a game submits nothing on the game's device). Applied after nri_subgroup_size.patch.

